{"id":"mestechko","lemma":"местечко","pos":"noun","rank":1610,"glosses":["A small village or town on the territory of the former Polish–Lithuanian Commonwealth.","A shtetl, small Jewish village."],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/41/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%87%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%87%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"местечка","plural":"местечки"},"examples":[{"text":"Мы найдём себе местечко.","en":"We'll find a place of our own.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to find","l":"найти"},{"g":"myself","l":"себя"},null]},{"text":"Я знаю одно местечко, куда мы можем пойти.","en":"I know a place we can go.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null,null,{"g":"where?"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to go"}]},{"text":"Я занял тебе местечко.","en":"I saved you a seat.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to borrow","l":"занять"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null]},{"text":"Том знает все крутые местечки в городе.","en":"Tom knows all the cool spots in town.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"everyone, everybody"},{"g":"steep","l":"крутой"},null,{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Вроде неплохое местечко.","en":"This looks like a nice place.","words":[{"g":"like"},{"g":"good, not bad","l":"неплохой"},null]}]}